    <MetaInfo>
      <NameIsFileName value="True" />
      <Name>00_orchestrator</Name>
      <Description>One-click pipeline run. Pre-flight checks (database, no stuck run, config, DQ rules, calendar, inbound files), then the seven stages in dependency order - 01 ingest SQL, 02 ingest JSON, 03 ingest CSV, 04 DQ gate, 04b DQ feedback, 05 warehouse load, 06 export - each in a Control Container that starts only if the previous stage logged no error, then a run summary. Every stage shares this run's timestamp in its LoadRunId.</Description>
